1. One shall believe in one God, the Father almighty, who made heaven and earth, all things visible and invisible.

2. One shall believe in one Lord Jesus Christ, Only-begotten son of God, born from the father before all ages. God from God, Ligth from Ligth, true God from true God.

3. That he is begotten, not made, and is consubstantial with the Father, and that through him all things were made.

4. That for us mankind, and for our salvation, came down from heaven, and by the power of the Holy Spirit was incarnate, and born of the Virgin Mary, and became man.

5. That for our sake, he was crucified, under Pontius Pilate, suffered death and was burried, rising again on the third day, in accordance with the Scriptures

6. That he ascended in to heaven, and is seated at the right hand of the Father.

7. That he will come again in glory to judge the living and the dead. And His kingdom will have no end.

8. One shall also believe in the Holy Spirit, the giver of life.

9. Must accept the Spirit proceeds from the Father AND the Son.

10. The Spirit shall be adored and glorified in conjunction with the Father and the Son.

11. Accept the Spirit is the one who spoke through the prophets.

12. One shall believe in ONE, HOLY, CATHOLIC and APOSTOLIC Church.

13. Must Confess one Baptism, for the forgiveness of sins.

14. Look forward to the ressurection of the dead, and the live that is to come.

